  "stage": "A09 native bounded parameter optimization with analytic RF design validation",
  "base_commit": "d06fe4abcb90537b8350326052c6119d1737a29a",
  "implementation": [
    "Deterministic complete coordinate polling over finite box bounds",
    "Real, logarithmic and exactly representable integer parameters with fixed-parameter support",
    "Explicit evaluation/iteration caps, objective target, cancellation and numerical-resolution stops",
    "Default stop-on-invalid objective; explicit reject policy, preserved incumbent and bounded failure diagnostics",
    "Optional complete evaluation history; recording does not affect candidate sequence",
    "Standalone RF LC matching design outputs full machine-readable inputs, options, result and evaluation trace"
  ],
  "independent_checks": [
    "Known mixed real/log/integer minimizer and bound/nonsmooth minimizers",
    "Best full-poll direction rather than first improvement",
    "Same-environment full trace replay and history-disabled search identity",
    "Failure, nonfinite output, budget, cancellation, fixed parameters and numerical-resolution distinctions",
    "Invalid requests rejected before objective invocation",
    "RF LC network optimum compared with analytic L=25/omega and C=.02/omega",
    "Every recorded RF objective independently recomputed from physical impedance, not network S assembly"
  ],
